---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About | Fireside Library" activeNav="about">

<header class="bg-accent pt-28 pb-12 text-white">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12">
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black tracking-tight">About this project</h1>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="py-12 border-b border-gray-200">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12">
    <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-gray-900 leading-snug max-w-3xl">Written materials to make it easier to have meaningful conversations about the Baha'i Faith.</p>
    <p class="text-[1rem] leading-[1.7] text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mt-4">Each fireside is a written guide for a single 2-to-3-hour conversation, designed for a group of 4–8 people. They open with questions, ground discussion in passages from the Baha'i Writings, and never assume the reader subscribes to the teachings.</p>
    <p class="text-[1rem] leading-[1.7] text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mt-4">They are free and open source — you're welcome to download them, edit them, mix them up, and contribute however you'd like.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- What it is / Who it's for -->
<section class="py-16">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12">

    <h2 class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-gray-500 font-bold mb-4">01 — Quick reference</h2>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-12">
      <div class="border border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-6">
        <p class="text-[0.6875rem] uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-500 font-semibold mb-1">Format</p>
        <p class="text-[0.95rem] text-gray-800 leading-relaxed">2–3 sections per fireside. Each section has opening questions, readings, and discussion questions.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="border border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-6">
        <p class="text-[0.6875rem] uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-500 font-semibold mb-1">Duration</p>
        <p class="text-[0.95rem] text-gray-800 leading-relaxed">A single session of 2–3 hours. Stop after the first section if the group runs long; each stands on its own.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="border border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-6">
        <p class="text-[0.6875rem] uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-500 font-semibold mb-1">Group size</p>
        <p class="text-[0.95rem] text-gray-800 leading-relaxed">4–8 people. Typically a mix of Baha'is and seekers.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="border border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-6">
        <p class="text-[0.6875rem] uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-500 font-semibold mb-1">Sources</p>
        <p class="text-[0.95rem] text-gray-800 leading-relaxed">Baha'u'llah, the Bab, 'Abdu'l-Baha, Shoghi Effendi, and the Universal House of Justice.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- What's in a fireside -->
<section class="py-16 border-t border-gray-200 bg-gray-50">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12">

    <h2 class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-gray-500 font-bold mb-2">02 — Anatomy of a fireside</h2>
    <p class="text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight mb-8">Four building blocks</p>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
      <div class="bg-white rounded-lg p-5 border border-gray-200">
        <div class="text-3xl font-black text-accent/30 mb-2">01</div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-sm mb-2">Sections</h3>
        <p class="text-[0.8125rem] text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Two or three. The first introduces the subject. The second goes deeper or shifts angle.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-lg p-5 border border-gray-200">
        <div class="text-3xl font-black text-accent/30 mb-2">02</div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-sm mb-2">Opening questions</h3>
        <p class="text-[0.8125rem] text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Invitations to share lived experience before reading. <em>"Have you ever felt the presence of the divine?"</em></p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-lg p-5 border border-gray-200">
        <div class="text-3xl font-black text-accent/30 mb-2">03</div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-sm mb-2">Readings</h3>
        <p class="text-[0.8125rem] text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Written context interwoven with passages from the Baha'i Writings.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-lg p-5 border border-gray-200">
        <div class="text-3xl font-black text-accent/30 mb-2">04</div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-sm mb-2">Discussion questions</h3>
        <p class="text-[0.8125rem] text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Less about the text, more about what the group thinks. The part where people forget what time it is.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Stages -->
<section class="py-16 border-t border-gray-200">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12">

    <h2 class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-gray-500 font-bold mb-2">03 — Stages of interest</h2>
    <p class="text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight mb-2">Pick the materials that match where your group is at</p>
    <p class="text-[0.95rem] text-gray-600 mb-8 max-w-2xl">Each fireside is tagged with a stage. The subjects, depth, and what the text assumes about the reader all shift accordingly.</p>

    <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse">
      <thead>
        <tr class="border-b-2 border-gray-300">
          <th class="py-3 pr-4 text-[0.75rem] uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-500 font-bold w-32">Stage</th>
          <th class="py-3 pr-4 text-[0.75rem] uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-500 font-bold w-48">For</th>
          <th class="py-3 text-[0.75rem] uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-500 font-bold">What to expect</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody class="text-[0.9375rem]">
        <tr class="border-b border-gray-200">
          <td class="py-4 pr-4 font-bold text-gray-900">Discovery</td>
          <td class="py-4 pr-4 text-gray-700">First-time encounters</td>
          <td class="py-4 text-gray-600">Nothing assumed. Opens with universal human experience.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="border-b border-gray-200">
          <td class="py-4 pr-4 font-bold text-gray-900">Investigation</td>
          <td class="py-4 pr-4 text-gray-700">Active explorers</td>
          <td class="py-4 text-gray-600">Designed for people interested in exploring what the Baha'i Faith is.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="border-b border-gray-200">
          <td class="py-4 pr-4 font-bold text-gray-900">Consolidation</td>
          <td class="py-4 pr-4 text-gray-700">Newly declared Baha'is</td>
          <td class="py-4 text-gray-600">Designed for people who subscribe to the Baha'i teachings and want to learn how to apply them to their lives.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td class="py-4 pr-4 font-bold text-gray-900">Service</td>
          <td class="py-4 pr-4 text-gray-700">Settled into the community</td>
          <td class="py-4 text-gray-600">Continue with Ruhi and other institute materials.</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <div class="mt-10">
      <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-accent text-white font-semibold text-[0.9375rem] px-6 py-3 rounded-md no-underline hover:-translate-y-px transition">Browse the library →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

</Layout>
